  "title": "Cranberry Ginger Chutney with Thai Chiles",
  "description": "Get a touch of heat onto your holiday dinner table by using a Thai chile pepper in a cranberry chutney bursting with apple, orange, and cinnamon flavors.",
  "authors": [
